{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c6cb2be483b87839","name":"Krayt's Honor","source":{"id":"source:reference-c6cb2be483b87839","title":"Krayt's Honor","revision":18732,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:38:31Z","sha256":"c548266f72207ce7675d6c9efe5ee0faaf8a67006802730830886b6aaad714c2","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18732","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Krayt%27s%20Honor&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c6cb2be483b87839","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Krayt's Honor"]}," is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gozanti Cruiser"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gozanti_Cruiser","referenceId":"reference:550d916de79fc2ea"}," most famous for once defending the personal luxury yacht of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jabba the Hutt"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jabba_the_Hutt","referenceId":"reference:4f1583c9ec5e6852"}," prior to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Clone Wars"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Clone_Wars"},". At that time is was captained by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kel Dor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kel_Dor","referenceId":"reference:fb61f4510d65d959"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Siqo Vass"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Siqo_Vass?action=edit&redlink=1"},". However, in an effort to avoid the prejudices of increasing humanocentrism, he often had the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," female ",{"tag":"a","children":["Layn Wynest"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Layn_Wynest?action=edit&redlink=1"}," pose as captain. Captain Vass hired his ship out as a Q-Ship, a military-grade vessel posing as a common cargo craft to lure pirates in close enough to destroy them. Vass was willing to defend legitimate merchantmen from any attackers, including Trade Federation ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships"}," attempting to enforce illegal embargoes. The Trade Federation placed a bounty on Vass's head, but the patronage of a grateful Jabba ensured that ",{"tag":"i","children":["Krayt's Honor"]}," could always find a safe harbor.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Krayt's Honor"]}," was significantly upgunned with the addition of three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Turbolasers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Turbolasers"}," and a second ",{"tag":"a","children":["Proton Torpedo Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Proton_Torpedo_Launcher"}," (and an expanded payload). The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Proton Torpedo Launchers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Proton_Torpedo_Launchers"}," are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fire-Linked"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fire-Linked"}," and often used by the captain as an opening salvo (Since the captain is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"},", he gains a +2 on attack rolls with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Proton Torpedoes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Proton_Torpedoes","referenceId":"reference:89c41c332c03f2dd"},", already added into the ship's statistics). Its biggest offensive surprise was its three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Turbolasers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Turbolasers"},", able to pack a heavy enough punch to damage ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},". However, Captain Vass tried not to reveal the big guns' presence unless forced to, since they were highly illegal.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In addition to its expanded offensive capability, Vass had his ship reinforced and augmented with military-grade deflector shields. The resulting defenses weren't enough to hold off a capital-class ship, but could absorb a great deal more ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"}," hits than the ship's humble appearance would suggest.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Expert)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Krayt's Honor"]}," Statistics (CL 11)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +0; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 20 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 14), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 32; +18 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 180; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 20; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://